---
title: dotfiles
summary: Chezmoi-managed Linux desktop. One tool per job, text-only config.
stack: chezmoi, bash, helix, kitty, tmux, rofi, polybar
repo: https://github.com/jplej/dotfiles
status: production
---

Minimal, keyboard-driven Ubuntu setup. Helix as editor, kitty as terminal,
tmux for multiplexing, rofi as launcher, polybar as status bar. Nord theme
across everything. No plugin managers, no GUI settings panels.

Secret-scanning gate on every commit (gitleaks via pre-commit) and on every
push (GitHub Actions). The whole setup rebuilds on a fresh Ubuntu install in
minutes.
